Recommends: fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, konsole
Description: Nexus global theme for KDE Plasma 6
 The NexusOS Engineering Edition look-and-feel package "Nexus":
 .
  * Nexus colour scheme (dark, teal accent) generated from design tokens
  * global theme with top system panel and floating bottom dock layout
  * Nexus icon theme (Breeze Dark plus NexusOS launcher icons)
  * Nexus Konsole profile and terminal palette
 .
 Installing the package only makes the theme available; it does not change
 any existing user's configuration. Select it in System Settings > Global
 Theme, or install nexusos-desktop to make it the default for new sessions.
